<main class="zd-support">

  <section class="zdsup-hero">
    <p class="zdsup-eyebrow">Support the Mission</p>
    <h1>Help build intentional technology for real life.</h1>
    <p>
      Ziyu Development is building apps like Goal Grower to help people grow,
      focus, reflect, and live more intentionally. Your support helps move these
      projects from ideas into real products.
    </p>

    <div class="zdsup-actions">
      <a href="#support-options">Support Development</a>
      <a href="/pages/projects">View Projects</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdsup-impact">
    <div>
      <p class="zdsup-eyebrow">Why Support Matters</p>
      <h2>Every contribution helps keep development moving.</h2>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p>
        Support helps cover app testing, design tools, hosting, development time,
        product samples, software costs, and launch preparation.
      </p>
      <p>
        This does not guarantee a specific reward or outcome. It helps fund the
        process of building, testing, improving, and launching Ziyu Development projects.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdsup-options" id="support-options">
    <div class="zdsup-section-head">
      <p class="zdsup-eyebrow">Ways to Support</p>
      <h2>Choose the way that fits you.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zdsup-grid">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Buy a product</h3>
        <p>Shop digital products, journals, merch, desk tools, and support items.</p>
        <a href="/collections/all">Shop All Products</a>
      </article>

      <article class="zdsup-dark">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Support Goal Grower</h3>
        <p>Help fund testing, polish, app store preparation, and future features.</p>
        <a href="/pages/goal-grower">View Goal Grower</a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Join beta testing</h3>
        <p>Test apps early and help shape the direction before launch.</p>
        <a href="/pages/beta-access">Get Beta Access</a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Share the mission</h3>
        <p>Tell someone about Ziyu Development, Goal Grower, or the community.</p>
        <a href="/pages/community">Join Community</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdsup-funding">
    <div class="zdsup-funding__copy">
      <p class="zdsup-eyebrow">What It Funds</p>
      <h2>Your support goes into the building process.</h2>
      <p>
        Ziyu Development is still growing. Support helps make it possible to keep
        testing, designing, improving, and launching products with care.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zdsup-funding-list">
      <article>
        <span>Design</span>
        <p>UI polish, branding, product visuals, and better user experience.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Development</span>
        <p>Building app features, fixing bugs, maintaining code, and improving performance.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Testing</span>
        <p>Beta testing, app store preparation, product validation, and feedback systems.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Operations</span>
        <p>Hosting, software tools, product samples, platform fees, and business costs.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdsup-note">
    <p class="zdsup-eyebrow">Important Note</p>
    <h2>Support is not a guarantee of a finished product.</h2>
    <p>
      Ziyu Development is building in public. Some ideas may change, pause, merge,
      or disappear as testing continues. Support helps fund development work, but
      it does not guarantee a specific product, timeline, reward, or outcome.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zdsup-cta">
    <p class="zdsup-eyebrow">Build With Us</p>
    <h2>Support the next stage of Ziyu Development.</h2>
    <p>
      Shop products, join beta testing, or follow the projects as they grow.
    </p>

    <div class="zdsup-actions">
      <a href="/collections/all">Shop All Products</a>
      <a href="/pages/beta-access">Become a Beta Tester</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Support Page",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Support Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}